---
import MainLayout from '../../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
import ContactCTA from '../../../components/ContactCTA.astro';

const title = 'Drain Cleaning in Mason City, Iowa | A-1 Drain Cleaning';
const description = 'Need drain cleaning in Mason City, Iowa? A-1 Drain Cleaning helps homeowners with clogged and backed-up drains. Call 641-530-2728.';
---

<MainLayout title={title} description={description} path="/services/drain-cleaning/">
  <Header />
  <main id="main">
    <section class="bg-[#1A1A68] text-white">
      <div class="container py-14 sm:py-18 lg:py-24">
        <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-300">
          <a href="/" class="hover:text-white">Home</a>
          <span class="mx-2" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
          <a href="/services/" class="hover:text-white">Services</a>
          <span class="mx-2" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
          <span class="text-white">Drain Cleaning</span>
        </nav>
        <p class="mt-5 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-red-300">Mason City • North Iowa</p>
        <h1 class="mt-3 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-black leading-[.98] tracking-tight sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">Drain Cleaning in Mason City, Iowa</h1>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-200 sm:text-xl">When a drain quits working, you usually know pretty quickly. A-1 Drain Cleaning provides drain cleaning in Mason City, Iowa, for homeowners dealing with clogged or backed-up drains.</p>
        <a href="tel:+16415302728" class="call-button mt-8 inline-block rounded-md bg-[#c52b34] px-7 py-4 text-center text-lg font-black text-white shadow-lg hover:bg-[#a82129]">CALL 641-530-2728</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-white py-16 sm:py-20">
      <div class="container grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_.85fr] lg:items-start">
        <article>
          <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#b4232b]">Drain cleaning</p>
          <h2 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-5xl">Drain problems can start small</h2>
          <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">A drain problem does not always begin with a complete blockage. You may first notice that water is draining slower than it used to. Over time, the problem can get worse until the drain will not flow normally.</p>
          <ul class="mt-6 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <li class="border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 font-semibold leading-7 text-slate-700">Water draining slowly</li>
            <li class="border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 font-semibold leading-7 text-slate-700">A drain that repeatedly backs up</li>
            <li class="border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 font-semibold leading-7 text-slate-700">Water standing in a sink or tub</li>
            <li class="border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 font-semibold leading-7 text-slate-700">A drain that stops flowing</li>
            <li class="border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 font-semibold leading-7 text-slate-700">Water coming back up through a drain</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-6 leading-8 text-slate-700">The important part is identifying which drain is causing the problem and what is happening in the line. Not every drainage problem is the same, so drain cleaning is not automatically the answer to every plumbing or sewer problem.</p>

          <h2 class="mt-10 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950">Mason City drain cleaning</h2>
          <p class="mt-5 leading-8 text-slate-700">A-1 Drain Cleaning is based in Mason City and provides drain-cleaning service for local homeowners. If you are dealing with a clogged drain or a backup, explain what you are seeing when you call. Let A-1 Drain Cleaning know which fixture is affected and whether the problem is slow drainage, a complete blockage, or water backing up.</p>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-700">That information can help determine what kind of drain problem you are dealing with before the service call.</p>

          <h2 class="mt-10 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950">When a drain backup needs attention</h2>
          <p class="mt-5 leading-8 text-slate-700">A single slow drain can be frustrating. A backup is a different matter, especially when wastewater is involved.</p>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-700">If water is coming back up through a drain, avoid continuing to use fixtures that may be feeding the affected line until the problem is addressed. Additional water can make an existing backup worse.</p>

          <section class="mt-10 border-l-4 border-[#b4232b] bg-slate-50 p-6" aria-labelledby="drain-backup-warning">
            <h2 id="drain-backup-warning" class="text-2xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950">Water backing up through a drain?</h2>
            <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 leading-7 text-slate-700">
              <li>Stop running water where possible while the backup is active.</li>
              <li>Do not keep testing the line by running more fixtures.</li>
              <li>Keep people and pets away from wastewater.</li>
              <li>Tell A-1 Drain Cleaning which fixture is affected and whether other drains are changing when water is used.</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <h2 class="mt-10 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950">Drain cleaning in Mason City</h2>
          <p class="mt-5 leading-8 text-slate-700">If you have a clogged or backed-up drain in Mason City, Iowa, call A-1 Drain Cleaning at <a href="tel:+16415302728" class="font-bold text-[#b4232b] underline underline-offset-4">641-530-2728</a>.</p>

          <section class="mt-10" aria-labelledby="drain-cleaning-faq">
            <h2 id="drain-cleaning-faq" class="text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950">Drain cleaning questions</h2>
            <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950">What does A-1 Drain Cleaning do?</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 leading-8 text-slate-700">A-1 Drain Cleaning provides drain-cleaning service in Mason City, Iowa.</p>
            <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950">What are signs that I may have a clogged drain?</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 leading-8 text-slate-700">Slow drainage, standing water, a drain that stops flowing, or water backing up can indicate a drainage problem.</p>
            <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950">What should I do if water is backing up through a drain?</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 leading-8 text-slate-700">Avoid continuing to use fixtures that may be feeding the affected line and call A-1 Drain Cleaning at 641-530-2728.</p>
            <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950">Where is A-1 Drain Cleaning located?</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 leading-8 text-slate-700">A-1 Drain Cleaning is based at 206 29th St SW, Mason City, Iowa 50401.</p>
            <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950">How do I contact A-1 Drain Cleaning?</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 leading-8 text-slate-700">Call <a href="tel:+16415302728" class="font-bold text-[#b4232b] underline underline-offset-4">641-530-2728</a>.</p>
          </section>
        </article>

        <aside class="lg:sticky lg:top-6">
          <div class="border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-6 shadow-sm">
            <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#b4232b]">Need drain cleaning?</p>
            <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950">Call A-1 Drain Cleaning</h2>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">Have a clogged or backed-up drain in Mason City? Call A-1 Drain Cleaning at 641-530-2728.</p>
            <a href="tel:+16415302728" class="call-button mt-5 block rounded-md bg-[#c52b34] px-6 py-4 text-center font-black text-white hover:bg-[#a82129]">Call 641-530-2728</a>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <ContactCTA />
  </main>
  <Footer />
</MainLayout>
